        "valueString": "No fevers, night sweats, weight loss (weight stable), sore throat currently, dental pain, oral ulcers, skin lesions, new lymph node areas, dysphagia, shortness of breath, or voice change. Appetite is okay. Energy is up and down, attributed to long days and recent viral illness."
